DATA LICENCE
============

The MIT licence in LICENSE covers the CODE in this repository only — the
Streamlit application, the build notes and the configuration. It does not
cover the data.

Source data
-----------

The data in data/kainga_ora_housing_public.duckdb is derived from New Zealand
government publications. Each source dataset remains under its own publisher's
licence, recorded per dataset in DATA_SOURCES.yaml and summarised in
ATTRIBUTION.md:

  - MBIE / Tenancy Services, rental bond data ................... CC BY 3.0 NZ
  - Ministry of Social Development, Housing Register,
    Transfer Register and housing support statistics ............ CC BY 4.0
  - Ministry of Housing and Urban Development / MCERT,
    Public Housing Quarterly Report ............................. CC BY 4.0
  - Kāinga Ora – Homes and Communities, housing statistics ...... UNVERIFIED

  CC BY 4.0    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  CC BY 3.0 NZ https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/nz/

Each licence above was read from the publisher on 2026-08-30; the page it was
read from is recorded per dataset in DATA_SOURCES.yaml as licence_evidence.

The Kāinga Ora housing statistics licence could NOT be verified:
kaingaora.govt.nz sits behind a web application firewall that refuses
non-browser clients, and Kāinga Ora has no data.govt.nz catalogue record for
these statistics. No licence is claimed for that data. Anyone wishing to
redistribute figures derived from it should establish the licence with Kāinga
Ora first.

Anyone redistributing this derived data must attribute those publishers under
the licence that applies to each dataset. Attribution does not imply
endorsement: this project is independent and is not affiliated with, endorsed
by, or produced on behalf of Kāinga Ora, MSD, HUD/MCERT or MBIE.

The data has been modified — downloaded, staged, transformed, and in places
mixed with synthetic records. It is a demonstration of method, not published
statistics, and must not be relied on for operational, policy or reporting
purposes.

Synthetic data
--------------

Tables in the SYN schema, and the curated territorial authority and Auckland
local board centroids, are generated or authored by Celnic Consulting for
demonstration purposes. They are offered as CC0 and carry no statistical
meaning: they describe no real property, tenancy, household or applicant, and
no real boundary.
